COMMENT ON FUNCTION api.next_record_model_identifier(p_model_id uuid) IS 'MDL-01 step 1: atomically allocate the next identifier for a workspace model, e.g. CB-0007. The counter is per (workspace, identifier prefix) in internal.id_sequences and is never reused.';
