COMMENT ON FUNCTION api.sample_measurement_provenance(p_sample_record_id uuid) IS 'LAB-03: read-only aggregation of a sample''s authoritative measurements from linked Dataset rows and instrument QC/integration, each with row provenance. The standalone sample_measurements table is not read.';
